{"seq":37,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28503"},"reason":"New question on Sobek, the crocodile god and one of the best-known animal-headed deities missing from the article; verified on Wikipedia's Sobek article (crocodile-headed, Shedet/Crocodilopolis in the Faiyum, mummified crocodiles as cult images) and its Temple of Kom Ombo article (double temple built 180–47 BC, shared with Haroeris).","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sobek"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temple_of_Kom_Ombo"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Sobek"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Sobek"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Себек"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[2146,5],"de":[2403,5],"ru":[1980,5]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"-180","end":"-47","precision":"year","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"The double temple of Sobek and Haroeris at Kom Ombo is built under the Ptolemies","labelDe":"Der Doppeltempel von Sobek und Haroeris in Kom Ombo wird unter den Ptolemäern erbaut","labelRu":"При Птолемеях строится двойной храм Себека и Хароериса в Ком-Омбо"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sobek","title":"Sobek – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"0fa95b73cbed"},
{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27503"},"reason":"Open question for the new fact: New question on Sobek, the crocodile god and one of the best-known animal-headed deities missing from the article; verified on Wikipedia's Sobek article (crocodile-headed, Shedet/Crocodilopolis in the Faiyum, mummified crocodiles as cult images) and its Temple of Kom Ombo article (double temple built 180–47 BC, shared with Haroeris).","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"Which crocodile-headed god of ancient Egypt was worshipped in the Faiyum city the Greeks called Crocodilopolis and in the double temple of Kom Ombo?"},{"field":"de","new":"Welcher krokodilköpfige Gott des alten Ägypten wurde in der Fayum-Stadt verehrt, die die Griechen Krokodilopolis nannten, und im Doppeltempel von Kom Ombo?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Какой бог Древнего Египта с головой крокодила почитался в фаюмском городе, который греки называли Крокодилополем, и в двойном храме в Ком-Омбо?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28503"}],"hash":"2601fd258aac"},
